   "geometry_notes": [
    "Width W, depth D, void diameters D1/D2, void spacing A/B and void-centre depth C are printed in the File 12.05-5 table; voids are circular.",
    "Shear key per File 12.05-10, each side: 3/8 in recess over the upper 4 in, 3/8 in 45-degree transition, 3/4 in recess below, ending 8 in below top with a 3/4 in 45-degree bottom chamfer. The key recess is measured from the beam side face (1/4 in from joint centreline).",
    "The published net area and inertia do NOT deduct shear keys ('consistent with the PCI Bridge Design Manual, 4th edition'); shear_keys=False reproduces them exactly (rectangle minus voids). The default outline includes the VDOT key.",
    "The 3/4 in drip V-notch (Drip Detail, typ. each side) at the soffit and the 3 in transverse tendon holes are omitted (<0.5 in^2 each; holes are local)."
   ],
