   "geometry_notes": [
    "Section sketch prints 6 in top slab, 6 in bottom slab, 5 in webs and 3x3 in void chamfers; overall widths 3'-0\"/4'-0\" and depth D. Stroke labels read at 300 dpi.",
    "Key-less rectangle-minus-void gives exactly published area + 20 in^2 for all eight sizes, confirming the 6/6/5/3 void; the table deducts a PCI-4th-edition shear key of ~20 in^2 whose shape is not given in the VDOT document.",
    "The outline uses the VDOT key actually drawn in File 12.06-11 (about 12.8 in^2 total), so implemented areas are ~7.2 in^2 (1.0-1.2%) above the published net area and Ix 1.0-1.4% above; these residuals are pinned in tests rather than fitted.",
    "Drip V-notches, transverse tendon holes and void drains are omitted. Exterior-beam properties (File 12.06-7) are not separate profiles here."
   ],
